        {
          "text": " koloma ŋesi airiamakin ka Asa, kotema ŋes atiar, “Kopupokinai, Asa, ka Yuda kere ka Benyamin: ejai EJAKAIT kayes, naijaatar yesi kaŋes; arai imootos ŋes, idumunete; konye arai ijalete ŋes, ŋes da kijali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.2",
